cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Se usi questo strumento, citalo così. / If you use this tool, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Specimen Reading Room"
abstract: >-
  A browser-based tool for the assisted reading of type specimens: an AI model
  (Google Gemini) fills in a closed-vocabulary observation grid from photographs
  of a specimen, which the researcher can verify, correct and compare with a
  blind manual coding. Developed within the doctoral research "La mediazione
  della tipografia in Europa e Italia: specimen ed ephemera promozionali per
  una storiografia tra type e graphic design (1952–1978)".
authors:
